  "translation": "Na long yia namba tupela, taim ol i kamap long haus bilong Elohim, long Yerusalayim, long mun namba tupela, Zerubabel pikinini bilong Shealtiel, na Yesua pikinini bilong Yotsadak, na ol narapela brata bilong ol, ol pris, na ol Levi, na olgeta man i kam long kalabus i go long Yerusalayim, ol i statim wok, na ol i kirapim ⟨את⟩ ol Levi, long man teti yia i go antap, bilong bosim wok bilong haus bilong Yahwe.",
